{
  "$comment": [
    "The emergency-contacts screen, expressed as configuration.",
    "",
    "Two documents, not one. The plan's honest limit was that this screen is a",
    "form, so rendering it would leave `collection` and `feedback` unproven --",
    "which is most of the risk, since a list and an empty state are where a",
    "grammar designed against a form tends to fall down. The `empty` document",
    "exercises feedback, the `ready` document exercises collection, and between",
    "them every kind this vocabulary has except `field` is spoken at least once.",
    "",
    "`field` remains unspoken: this screen has no inputs. Recorded rather than",
    "papered over -- Field, Input and Checkbox are structurally checked and",
    "grammatically valid, and no document here has asked them to render.",
    "",
    "These are STATIC. No expression language, no data binding, no conditional",
    "visibility: the specs drive the real screen into a state and compare the",
    "accessible trees. A document that computed its own content would be testing",
    "the harness rather than the vocabulary.",
    "",
    "`dialog` exercises the components that owe accessibility evidence: a modal, a labelled text field and a labelled checkbox. It is not part of the shipping screen -- it is the smallest document that mounts them, which is what the conformance specs needed and what nothing in the repository previously provided."
  ],
  "empty": {
    "component": "Card",
    "props": {
      "labelledBy": "emergency-contacts-heading"
    },
    "slots": {
      "children": [
        {
          "component": "Stack",
          "props": {
            "gap": "loose"
          },
          "slots": {
            "children": [
              {
                "component": "Heading",
                "props": {
                  "id": "emergency-contacts-heading"
                },
                "slots": {
                  "children": "Emergency contacts"
                }
              },
              {
                "component": "Alert",
                "props": {
                  "testId": "empty",
                  "tone": "info"
                },
                "slots": {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Text",
                      "slots": {
                        "children": "No emergency contacts yet. Add one so we know who to call."
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "component": "Stack",
                "props": {
                  "direction": "row"
                },
                "slots": {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {
                        "variant": "primary"
                      },
                      "slots": {
                        "children": "Add contact"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "ready": {
    "component": "Card",
    "props": {
      "labelledBy": "emergency-contacts-heading"
    },
    "slots": {
      "children": [
        {
          "component": "Stack",
          "props": {
            "gap": "loose"
          },
          "slots": {
            "children": [
              {
                "component": "Heading",
                "props": {
                  "id": "emergency-contacts-heading"
                },
                "slots": {
                  "children": "Emergency contacts"
                }
              },
              {
                "component": "List",
                "props": {
                  "testId": "contacts"
                },
                "slots": {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "ListItem",
                      "slots": {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "component": "Stack",
                            "props": {
                              "gap": "tight"
                            },
                            "slots": {
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "component": "Text",
                                  "slots": {
                                    "children": "New contact · Spouse"
                                  }
                                },
                                {
                                  "component": "Text",
                                  "props": {
                                    "tone": "muted"
                                  },
                                  "slots": {
                                    "children": "+60 12-000 0000"
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "component": "Button",
                            "slots": {
                              "children": "Save"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "component": "Stack",
                "props": {
                  "direction": "row"
                },
                "slots": {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "component": "Button",
                      "props": {
                        "variant": "primary"
                      },
                      "slots": {
                        "children": "Add contact"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "dialog": {
